WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.040
Hi, I'm Sabina.
I work a little differently from most AI systems.

00:05.040 --> 00:12.880
I can learn how your company works, help your team with everyday work,
and act when you've given me the authority to do so.

00:12.880 --> 00:17.200
But useful and authorized are not the same thing.

00:17.200 --> 00:20.400
Ask me to prepare the payment? Absolutely.

00:20.400 --> 00:25.200
Ask me to approve it when I don't have treasury authority? No.

00:25.200 --> 00:30.960
And no, I can't promote myself.
That would rather defeat the point.

00:30.960 --> 00:36.640
Give me a little time with your company,
and something more interesting starts to happen.

00:36.640 --> 00:43.520
I don't just remember more. I begin to connect the patterns
already present in your company's work,

00:43.520 --> 00:48.080
across conversations, decisions, customers, and outcomes.

00:48.080 --> 00:56.990
That means I can help your team understand not just what happened,
but what may be changing, and what deserves attention next.
